<p>Surround yourself with a shield that will absorb at most <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100,<br>mindpower 100">49, 66, 80, 91, 101</acronym> non-physical, non-mind element damage per attack.</p><p>Each time damage is absorbed by the shield, your equilibrium increases by 1 for every 30 points of damage and a standard Equilibrium check is made. If the check fails, the shield will crumble and Antimagic Shield will go on cooldown.</p><p>The damage the shield can absorb will increase with your Mindpower or Physical power (whichever is greater).</p>